You can't level-teleport from the quest levels to the main dungeon
levels.  You should have level-teleported to 1, as that would have
taken you to the top of the quest levels.

You're probably going to be stuck there for a long time.  The most
likely way you might be able to escape is by reading a confused non-
cursed teleportation scroll.  You probably need to alternate between
eating corpses, food, and praying for food -- in an attempt to survive
as long as possible.

Eventually, you will hopefully gain a way to confuse yourself
(probably by casting a spell that you will eventually forget), and
gain a non-cursed scroll of teleportation from a random corpse.  Then
you can try to level-teleport to level 1.


